<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK RESERVES RISE IN MAY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK RESERVES RISE IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's central bank said on Friday that its gold and foreign currency reserves rose in May to 8.2 billion kroons from 7.89 billion kroons.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that cash in circulation rose in the same period to 5.096 billion kroons from 5.0299 billion kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6 209 201</p>
